1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:04,058
有些重要的时刻，从一个声音开始。
Some meaningful moments begin with a sound.

2
00:00:04,196 --> 00:00:08,060
一声门铃，一句问候，一次擦肩而过。
A doorbell. A greeting. Someone passing by.

3
00:00:08,198 --> 00:00:11,270
让这些连接，被更多人感知。
Make those connections easier to notice.

4
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:16,970
SoundBridge，构想一款独立运行的声音感知手表。
SoundBridge imagines a standalone sound-aware watch.

5
00:00:17,286 --> 00:00:21,270
采集、识别、提醒，都在腕上完成。
Sensing, recognition and alerts — all on the wrist.

6
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:27,081
麦克风采集声音，将短时音频转换为频谱特征。
Microphones capture audio; short windows become spectral features.

7
00:00:27,189 --> 00:00:32,012
轻量模型在本地，区分门铃、人声、车铃和鸣笛。
A local model distinguishes doorbells, speech, bicycle bells and horns.

8
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:37,270
再通过置信度判断、连续确认与重复抑制，减少无效打扰。
Confidence checks, temporal confirmation and deduplication limit unwanted alerts.

9
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:43,813
门铃响起，识别结果触发专属振动，屏幕显示门铃事件。
A recognized doorbell triggers its haptic pattern and an on-screen event.

10
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:49,270
即使正在忙碌，也能知道有人来访。何时回应，由你决定。
Notice a visitor while you are busy. Choose when to respond.

11
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:54,311
开启交谈模式，系统优先提醒附近的人声。
Conversation mode prioritizes nearby speech.

12
00:00:54,416 --> 00:00:57,419
一次轻柔长振，提醒你抬头看看。
One gentle, sustained pulse invites you to look up.

13
00:00:57,524 --> 00:01:01,270
它提示有人说话，不判断对方是否正在叫你。
It detects speech, not whether someone is addressing you.

14
00:01:02,650 --> 00:01:06,903
户外模式关注车铃与鸣笛，识别后发送短促振动。
Outdoor mode focuses on bicycle bells and horns, with brief pulses.

15
00:01:07,008 --> 00:01:10,358
停一停，看看周围，再由自己判断下一步。
Pause, look around, and decide your next move.

16
00:01:10,463 --> 00:01:13,270
这是环境提示，不替代道路观察。
An awareness cue that does not replace looking around.

17
00:01:14,650 --> 00:01:17,393
事件类别，映射到不同的振动节奏。
Each event category maps to a different haptic rhythm.

18
00:01:17,494 --> 00:01:21,965
门铃是两组双击，人声是一段长振，交通提示是三次短振。
Doorbell: two paired taps. Speech: one long pulse. Traffic: three short taps.

19
00:01:22,066 --> 00:01:25,270
驱动触觉马达，让声音有了可学习的触感。
A haptic actuator turns sound categories into learnable sensations.

20
00:01:26,650 --> 00:01:29,835
方向提示，需要兼容的多麦克风硬件。
Direction cues require compatible multi-microphone hardware.

21
00:01:29,936 --> 00:01:33,559
比较声音到达不同麦克风的时间差，估计来向。
Compare arrival times across microphones to estimate the source direction.

22
00:01:33,661 --> 00:01:36,644
表盘用柔和扇区，提示大致方向。
A soft sector indicates an approximate direction.

23
00:01:36,746 --> 00:01:40,270
精度仍需在真实噪声和佩戴条件下验证。
Accuracy still needs validation with real noise and wrist placement.

24
00:01:41,650 --> 00:01:46,020
首次使用，开启感知，选择声音，再试一试振动。
Start awareness, choose your sounds, then preview the vibration.

25
00:01:46,127 --> 00:01:50,686
只接收选中的声音，文字大小与振动强度也能调整。
Choose the sounds to receive, plus text size and vibration strength.

26
00:01:50,793 --> 00:01:54,270
把偏好保存在本地，让提醒更适合自己。
Store preferences locally so alerts fit your needs.

27
00:01:55,650 --> 00:01:59,864
居家、交谈、户外，切换的是声音筛选规则。
Home, conversation and outdoors apply different sound filters.

28
00:01:59,972 --> 00:02:03,800
想安静时，暂停感知，停止采集与提醒。
Pause awareness to stop capture and alerts when you want quiet.

29
00:02:03,908 --> 00:02:06,270
准备好了，再轻触恢复。
Tap to resume when you are ready.

30
00:02:07,650 --> 00:02:11,158
方案默认在设备内处理，不保存原始录音。
The proposed default is local processing without saving raw recordings.

31
00:02:11,261 --> 00:02:15,599
若启用事件历史，只保留类别与时间，并由用户管理。
If event history is enabled, keep category and time under user control.

32
00:02:15,702 --> 00:02:19,270
这些隐私目标，仍需在最终软硬件中落实。
These privacy goals must be implemented in the final hardware and software.

33
00:02:20,650 --> 00:02:25,596
下一步，与聋人及重听人士共同设计、测试、完善。
Next: co-design, test and refine with deaf and hard-of-hearing people.

34
00:02:25,713 --> 00:02:29,270
SoundBridge。感知连接，自主回应。
SoundBridge. Feel connected. Choose your response.
